			"name": "Whispers of Betrayal",
			"system": {
				"actionType": {
					"value": "action"
				},
				"description": {
					"value": "<p>The haunt continues to confound victims' senses and inspire them to commit violence against each other.</p><p>Target a creature in the haunt's area dealing @Damage[(2d12+15)[void]] Damage on a @Check[type:will|dc:30|showDC:all]{basic Will save}.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected and temporarily immune for 1 minute.</p><p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p><p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.yblD8fOR1J8rDwEQ]{Confused} for 1 round and is targeted by the Your Lot, To Die curse.</p><p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.yblD8fOR1J8rDwEQ]{Confused} for 1 minute and is targeted by the Your Lot, To Die curse.</p>",
